 * 2. Triggers the Bitrise ai_teammate_test_automation workflow
 *    passing TICKET_KEY, INPUT_JQL, FEATURE_PR_URL, and FEATURE_PR_NUMBER
 * 3. Posts a Jira comment with the Bitrise build URL
