Another: `parseTriggerResult` — original logs '✅ Bitrise build triggered: build #' + (buildData.build_number || '?') AFTER parse. Mine: parse → log inside ✓.

But one real difference: iOS original comment built AFTER parseTriggerResult even if... ✓ same.

