5. `pickActualParams(params)` — pure: `params.ticket ? params : (params.jobParams || params)` CC 3. ✓
6. `resolveCustomParams(params, actualParams)` — pure: `(params.jobParams && params.jobParams.customParams) || (params.jobParams && params.jobParams) || actualParams.customParams || {}` CC 5. ✓ (tests: jobParams.customParams, jobParams flat, actualParams.customParams, none, jobParams-null w/ actual.customParams.)
7. `resolveTicketSummary(actualParams)` — `(actualParams.ticket.fields && actualParams.ticket.fields.summary) || ticketKey` CC 3. Small; keep inline in action? Inline adds CC 2 to action (&& + ||). Action budget matters more — extract. ✓
8. `resolveBitriseConfig(customParams)` — pure:
